```sql
--Description: Build the visitor’s 28‑Jan‑2021 navigation flow in a single pass
--             and show it as “PLP >> PDP …”.
--             • raw  : pull every `page_view` for user + day, grab URL
--             • typed: classify URL => PDP / PLP / OTHER via refined rules
--                     ▸ PDP  -> last segment has “+” AND url contains category
--                     ▸ PLP  -> 4th OR 5th segment = category, last segment no “+”
--             • ordered: sort chronologically and expose previous type
--             • dedup : keep only rows where the page_type changed
--             • final : concatenate remaining sequence with “ >> ”

